rGroup-module_titleInnerInsideDrawerGroup__-C6Vh">Services</div></div></a></li></ul></nav></li><li><div class="Drawer-module_defaultPromoDrawer__5Q8DI"><div class="NavPromoDrawer-module_wrapper__YeMdg NavPromoDrawer-module_colorTeal__uUgp2"><div class="NavPromoDrawer-module_intro__PdY1R"><div><div class="NavPromoDrawer-module_eyebrow__VlIwC">Resource Center</div><span class="NavPromoDrawer-module_heading__-cNLJ">Stay one step ahead of the trends</span></div><div class="NavPromoDrawer-module_overview__6DYLw">This content is packed with demos, best practices, industry trends, and more. See how to win in a fast-moving market.</div><a href="https://www.airtable.com/lp/resources" class="ActionButton-module_actionButton__sZl5R ActionButton-module_secondary__kHO9k" data-tracking-name="Explore all resources"><span>Explore all resources</span></a></div><div class="NavPromoDrawer-module_children__G07ao"><img class="Img-module_wrapper__7epC4" src="https://static.airtable.com/images/marketing-nav-resource.webp" height="772" width="1142"></div></div></div></li></ul></nav></div><a href="https://www.airtable.com/solutions/enterprise" tabindex="0" class="Link-module_navLink__S7Fvz ActionGroup-module_navLinkInsideActionGroup__6cWfX" data-tracking-name="enterprise">Enterprise</a><a href="https://airtable.com/pricing" tabindex="0" class="Link-module_navLink__S7Fvz ActionGroup-module_navLinkInsideActionGroup__6cWfX" data-tracking-name="pricing">Pricing</a><div class="v2-module_mobileActionLinkWrapper__CV1-X media-module_visibilityWrapper__5UowA media-module_hideForLg__s4mPD"><a href="https://www.airtable.com/contact-sales" tabindex="0" class="Link-module_navLink__S7Fvz ActionGroup-module_navLinkInsideActionGroup__6cWfX" data-tracking-name="book demo">Book demo</a><a href="https://airtable.com/login" tabindex="0" class="Link-module_navLink__S7Fvz ActionGroup-module_navLinkInsideActionGroup__6cWfX" data-tracking-name="sign in">Sign in</a></div></div></div></div><div class="ActionGroup-module_actionGroupWrap__95a8B"><a href="https://www.airtable.com/contact-sales" class="ActionButton-module_actionButton__sZl5R ActionButton-module_secondary__kHO9k ActionButton-module_tertiaryImportance__ojG90" data-tracking-name="book demo"><span>Book Demo</span></a><a href="https://airtable.com/signup" class="ActionButton-module_actionButton__sZl5R ActionButton-module_primary__s-Wsr ActionButton-module_primaryImportance__Io7zt" data-tracking-name="sign up for free"><span class="ActionButton-module_mediumAndUpText__AVOAo">Sign up for free</span><span class="ActionButton-module_baseTextOnly__HOK4-">Sign up</span></a><a href="https://airtable.com/login" tabindex="0" class="Link-module_navLink__S7Fvz ActionGroup-module_navLinkInsideActionGroup__6cWfX Link-module_secondaryImportance__L5zF8" data-tracking-name="sign in">Log in</a><button id="mobile-nav-toggle" class="Toggle-module_navToggleButton__fbDwt" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-nav-menu" aria-label="Open side menu"><div class="Toggle-module_hamburgerWrap__rqfcW"><span class="Toggle-module_hamburgerLines__SkNqG Toggle-module_topHamburgerLine__IfjuF"></span><span class="Toggle-module_hamburgerLines__SkNqG Toggle-module_bottomHamburgerLine__IcEBt"></span></div></button></div></nav><span role="button" tabindex="0" title="Press escape to close menu" class="Nav-module_backdropOverlay__q4v41"></span></header><div class="marketing-main flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col z-0"><main data-marketing-template="blocks" class="MarketingPageBlocks-module__7rSsmW__root font-body text-text-body w-full min-w-0 pb-16"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><section data-slot="hero" data-type="vertical-padded" class="hero-module-scss-module__mTXefG__root" data-block="contentStack" data-cms-variant="bkv3" aria-labelledby="_R_bav5tep5b_"><div class="hero-module-scss-module__mTXefG__shell"><div class="hero-module-scss-module__mTXefG__copy"><div data-slot="title" class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__root title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__alignCenter"><div class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__textStack"><span data-slot="badge" class="badge-module-scss-module__zEKSjq__root badge-module-scss-module__zEKSjq__primary">About Airtable</span><h1 id="_R_bav5tep5b_" class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__headline title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__headlineHeroLarge">Where ideas become infrastructure</h1><p class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__subhead title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__subheadHeroLarge">In 2012, we started with a simple belief: the people who know the work should build the systems. As agents expand the definition of who — and what — can build, that belief holds today. In Airtable, what one person figures out becomes how the whole company operates.</p></div><div class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__actions"><a href="https://airtable.com/signup" role="button" tabindex="0" data-slot="button" class="button-module-scss-module__jqKb6a__root button-module-scss-module__jqKb6a__primary">Try Airtable</a><a href="https://airtable.com/careers" role="button" tabindex="0" data-slot="button" class="button-module-scss-module__jqKb6a__root button-module-scss-module__jqKb6a__secondary">Join our team</a></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="w-full min-w-0"><section data-slot="features" data-type="media/side-by-side-swapped" class="features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__root" data-block="bifold" data-bifold-variant="inline" data-variant="bkv3" data-image-position="left" aria-labelledby="features_R_jav5tep5b_-title"><div class="features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__shell"><div class="features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__mediaBody"><div data-slot="title" class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__root title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__alignLeft features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__title"><div class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__textStack"><span data-slot="badge" class="badge-module-scss-module__zEKSjq__root badge-module-scss-module__zEKSjq__primary">Our purpose</span><h2 id="features_R_jav5tep5b_-title" class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__headline title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__headlineSectionLarge">To close the gap between “what if” and “it works”</h2><div class="title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__subhead title-module-scss-module__Gmh66W__subheadSectionLarge"><p>Rigidity, fragility, complexity, drudgery — four things that cost a company its best thinking. Airtable removes them. Teams model data to match how the business actually works, design workflows that improve instead of break, and hand agents the jobs nobody should be doing manually. All under the governance IT requires.</p></div></div></div><div class="features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__mediaFrame"><div class="features-module-scss-module__8-XBpW__mediaInner"><div class="MediaComponentBlock-module__0ynjlG__mediaWrapper"><figure class="MediaComponentBlock-module__0ynjlG__mediaBlock"><img alt="What we do" loading="lazy" width="0" height="0" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="MediaComponentBlock-module__0ynjlG__mediaImage" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:auto" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1536px" srcset="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.sanity.io%2Fimages%2Fhlcyrtq5%2Fproduction%2F4180d9ccb12bbdab751818a7a116f7ceedce0330-1650x2062.webp%3Fw%3D1600&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"></figure></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><div class="w-full min-w-0"><section data-slot="logos" data-type="flip" class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__root" aria-label="Trusted by the world's largest organizations" data-block="block-marquee" data-marquee-variant="logo" data-logo-variant="default" data-variant="bkv3"><div class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__shell"><div class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__headingFrame"><p class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__heading">Trusted by the world's largest organizations</p></div><ul class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__logos"><li class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__cell"><div class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__cycleCell"><div class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__slot logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__slotTopAnimating"><img alt="OpenAI logo" class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__logoImage" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/c3dd07f2b5f9b1da0b00f6a65a3092a02e5d1cc1-800x217.svg?w=336" data-airgap-id="2"></div><div class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__slot logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__slotBottomAnimating"><img alt="Publicis Groupe" class="logos-module-scss-module__ASx_Sq__logoImage" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/hlcyrtq5/production/bc191350ae958600ecfae3b38f